  "summary": "<p>For the first time, a U.S. Air Force officer shot down over Iran — mission call sign DUDE 44 Bravo — told America his story. In an exclusive 60 Minutes interview, Bravo delivered a powerful account of survival, faith, and combat leadership — a testament to the unmatched bravery of our nation’s warfighters and to [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/warrior-ethos-in-action-dude-44-bravos-incredible-story/\">Warrior Ethos in Action: DUDE 44 Bravo’s Incredible Story</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
